        "Id1": {
            "text": "Bionico (served at the dessert course) is a food made with granola found in Mexico. The currency in Mexico is the peso inhabited by the Mexicans. Cookie is a type of dessert."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "People from Mexico are called Mexicans, and they use the Mexican peso currency to purchase dessert dishes like cookies and Bionico. Bionico is a dish found in Mexico that is composed of granola, a Mexican ingredient."
